# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 2/5, item 29
# Base: apply after 0028.
#
# Adds exact greedy target verification:
# - first proposed token is checked against current target logits
# - if it matches, proposals are batch-forwarded by the 32B target
# - longest exact argmax prefix is accepted
# - mismatch emits the target argmax
# - all-accepted window emits one target "bonus" token
# - KV commits accepted draft prefix only
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0029_exact_greedy_verify_accept.patch

